---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Cookie Policy — CC3PO" description="CC3PO Cookie Policy. What cookies we use, why, and how to manage your preferences.">
  <section class="section legal-page" id="main-content" style="padding-top:120px;">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:800px;">
      <h1>Cookie Policy</h1>
      <p class="legal-updated">Last updated: May 19, 2026</p>

      <h2>What Are Cookies?</h2>
      <p>Cookies are small text files stored on your device when you visit a website. They help us remember your preferences, understand how you use our site, and improve your experience. This policy explains what cookies we use and how you can control them.</p>

      <h2>Essential Cookies (Always Active)</h2>
      <p>These cookies are necessary for the website to function and cannot be disabled:</p>
      <table class="cookie-table">
        <thead>
          <tr><th>Cookie</th><th>Purpose</th><th>Duration</th></tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td><code>cc3po_cookie_consent</code></td><td>Stores your cookie consent preferences</td><td>1 year</td></tr>
          <tr><td><code>__Host-session</code></td><td>Maintains your session for form submissions and scan results</td><td>Session</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>

      <h2>Analytics Cookies</h2>
      <p>We use <strong>Plausible Analytics</strong>, a privacy-friendly, self-hosted analytics tool. Plausible does <strong>not</strong> use cookies and does not track personal data. It collects anonymous aggregate data:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Page views (no personal identifiers)</li>
        <li>Referrer source (which website sent you here)</li>
        <li>Country (based on IP, not stored)</li>
        <li>Device type (desktop, mobile, tablet)</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Plausible is fully GDPR compliant without needing consent because it does not track personal data. However, we still respect your choice to opt out of analytics via our cookie banner.</p>

      <h2>Marketing Cookies</h2>
      <p>We currently <strong>do not use any third-party marketing or advertising cookies</strong>. If we add marketing tools in the future, we will update this policy and ensure they only load after your explicit consent.</p>

      <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
      <p>Our site may load content from these third-party services:</p>
      <table class="cookie-table">
        <thead>
          <tr><th>Service</th><th>Purpose</th><th>Privacy Policy</th></tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>Stripe</td><td>Payment processing for subscriptions</td><td><a href="https://stripe.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">stripe.com/privacy</a></td></tr>
          <tr><td>Google Fonts</td><td>Web font delivery</td><td><a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">policies.google.com/privacy</a></td></tr>
          <tr><td>Plausible</td><td>Privacy-friendly analytics (self-hosted)</td><td><a href="https://plausible.io/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">plausible.io/privacy</a></td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>

      <h2>How to Manage Cookies</h2>
      <p>You can manage your cookie preferences at any time:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Cookie Banner:</strong> Click "Customize" in the cookie banner at the bottom of any page</li>
        <li><strong>Browser Settings:</strong> Most browsers let you block or delete cookies in their settings</li>
        <li><strong>Clear localStorage:</strong> Open browser DevTools → Application → Local Storage → delete <code>cc3po_cookie_consent</code></li>
      </ul>
      <p>Please note: blocking essential cookies may prevent some features from working properly.</p>

      <h2>Do Not Track</h2>
      <p>We respect the Do Not Track (DNT) browser setting. If DNT is enabled, we will not load analytics scripts regardless of your cookie consent.</p>

      <h2>Data Retention</h2>
      <p>Cookie consent preferences are stored for 1 year, after which we will ask for your consent again. Analytics data is aggregated and retained for 14 months maximum.</p>

      <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>We may update this Cookie Policy from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated "Last updated" date. We encourage you to review this page periodically.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <div style="background:var(--bg-card);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:24px;margin-top:16px;">
        <p style="margin-bottom:8px;"><strong>CC3PO LLC</strong></p>
        <p style="margin-bottom:8px;">16299 Adobe Way, Lathrop, CA 95330</p>
        <p style="margin-bottom:8px;">📧 <a href="mailto:legal@cc3po.com">legal@cc3po.com</a></p>
        <p>📞 <a href="tel:+12097011137">(209) 701-1137</a></p>
      </div>

      <div style="margin-top:48px;text-align:center;">
        <a href="/" class="btn btn-secondary">← Back to Home</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal-page h1 {
    font-size: var(--text-5xl);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -1px;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
  }
  .legal-updated {
    font-size: var(--text-caption);
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2xl);
  }
  .legal-page h2 {
    font-size: var(--text-xl);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin: var(--space-xl) 0 var(--space-sm);
  }
  .legal-page p {
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.8;
  }
  .legal-page ul {
    list-style: disc;
    padding-left: 24px;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }
  .legal-page li {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .legal-page a {
    color: var(--accent);
    transition: color var(--duration-fast);
  }
  .legal-page a:hover {
    color: var(--accent-hover);
  }
  .cookie-table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin: var(--space-md) 0;
  }
  .cookie-table th {
    text-align: left;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    padding: 10px 12px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  }
  .cookie-table td {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    padding: 10px 12px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
  }
  .cookie-table code {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
    padding: 2px 6px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--accent);
  }
</style>